@page "/components"
@page "/components/introduce-cn"
@layout ComponentLayout

<PageTitle>组件介绍 · AntDesign.X.Blazor</PageTitle>

<header class="demo-doc-hero">
    <div>
        <div class="demo-kicker">Components</div>
        <h1>组件介绍</h1>
        <p>参考官方 Ant Design X 的组件介绍页，把组件先放进 AI 产品范式里解释，再进入具体示例。左侧是组件目录，右侧是介绍、分类、快速开始和 demo 入口。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-doc-hero-actions">
        <a class="demo-primary-button" href="components/sender">
            <Icon Type="thunderbolt" Theme="IconThemeType.Outline" />
            <span>体验 Sender</span>
        </a>
        <a class="demo-ghost-button"
           href="https://x.ant.design/components/introduce-cn"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <Icon Type="link" Theme="IconThemeType.Outline" />
            <span>官方参考</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="demo-doc-section">
    <h2>面向 AI 界面的组件体系</h2>
    <p>Ant Design X 的核心不是单个输入框或消息气泡，而是一套围绕 AI 交互旅程的界面语言。Blazor 版本延续这条路径：用强类型模型、事件回调和 RenderFragment，把官方 React 组件语义转换为 Blazor 开发体验。</p>
    <div class="demo-doc-feature-grid">
        <article>
            <Icon Type="message" Theme="IconThemeType.Outline" />
            <strong>对话优先</strong>
            <span>Bubble、Conversations、Sender 组成最小 AI 工作台。</span>
        </article>
        <article>
            <Icon Type="branches" Theme="IconThemeType.Outline" />
            <strong>过程可见</strong>
            <span>Think、ThoughtChain、Sources 让生成过程更可解释。</span>
        </article>
        <article>
            <Icon Type="tool" Theme="IconThemeType.Outline" />
            <strong>易于组合</strong>
            <span>组件保持低耦合，可以嵌入 Copilot、独立聊天或业务工作流。</span>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="demo-doc-section">
    <h2>RICH 范式映射</h2>
    <div class="demo-doc-rich-list">
        <article>
            <span>1</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Awaken 唤醒</h3>
                <p>用 Welcome 与 Prompts 提供初始引导，让用户知道可以如何开始。</p>
            </div>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>2</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Express 表达</h3>
                <p>用 Sender、Attachments、Suggestion 承接自然语言、文件和快捷指令。</p>
            </div>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>3</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Confirm 确认</h3>
                <p>用 Think 与 ThoughtChain 展示推理和工具调用，帮助用户判断结果质量。</p>
            </div>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>4</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Feedback 反馈</h3>
                <p>用 Actions、Sources、Notification 和 FileCard 处理采纳、追溯和状态反馈。</p>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="demo-doc-section">
    <h2>组件总览</h2>
    <p>组件分组对齐官方 Ant Design X 的组织方式，同时加入 Blazor 项目的 Markdown、Mermaid、XProvider 和 Playground 示例。</p>
    @foreach (var group in ComponentNav.Groups)
    {
        <section class="demo-overview-group">
            <h3>@group.Title</h3>
            <div class="demo-overview-grid">
                @foreach (var item in group.Items)
                {
                    <a class="demo-overview-card" href="@($"components/{item.Slug}")">
                        <span>@item.Title</span>
                        <code>@item.EnglishTitle</code>
                    </a>
                }
            </div>
        </section>
    }
</section>

<section class="demo-doc-section">
    <h2>快速开始</h2>
    <p>安装包、注册服务、引入样式后，用 XProvider 包裹页面，就可以像下面这样组合一个最小输入闭环。</p>
    <XCodeHighlighter Language="razor"
                      Code="@QuickStartCode" />
</section>

@code {
    private const string QuickStartCode = """
<XProvider Theme="light">
    <XBubbleList Items="@messages" />
    <XSender @bind-Value="@draft"
             Attachments="@attachments"
             OnSubmit="@Submit"
             OnFilesSelected="@AddFiles" />
</XProvider>
""";
}
